<div class="container mt-5">
  <h2 class="mb-4">Return Policy</h2>

  <p>At [Your Site Name], we strive to ensure customer satisfaction with every purchase. If you're not completely satisfied with your order, we're here to help.</p>

  <h4>Return Window</h4>
  <p>You can request a return within <strong>7 days</strong> of delivery for most products. Some products may have different return policies based on the seller or category.</p>

  <h4>Conditions for Returns</h4>
  <ul>
    <li>Items must be in original condition with tags and packaging.</li>
    <li>Electronics must be returned with all original accessories.</li>
    <li>Opened or used personal care items are not eligible for return.</li>
  </ul>

  <h4>How to Initiate a Return</h4>
  <ol>
    <li>Go to the "My Orders" section.</li>
    <li>Click "View Details" on the product you want to return.</li>
    <li>Select "Return" and choose a reason.</li>
    <li>Schedule a pickup date.</li>
  </ol>

  <h4>Refunds</h4>
  <p>Once the product is picked up and inspected, we will initiate your refund within <strong>2–5 business days</strong>.</p>

  <h4>Contact Us</h4>
  <p>Need help? <a href="/contact">Contact our support team</a>.</p>
</div>